e can resume those  kinds of activities  but you know i think most people  watching this will feel but the  government is right  to proceed cautiously and do nothing to  put at risk  the huge success that we have had in  terms of beating this forest  trust me you wouldn't want to hear me  singing mr whittingdale a quick question  about channel 4  before i let you go to what question is  the answer  privatize channel 4.  well there has been a huge  transformation in the way in which  people  watch tv with a lot of new entrants  which is fantastic news for the viewer  you now have a choice between  you know sky and netflix and amazon and  apple as well as the traditional public  service broadcasters  channel 4 has a very special place  amongst the broadcasters  it has been hugely successful but with  that kind of competition coming on in  order to sustain it over the long term  we think it will need investment it only  capital to invest in programming  and it is subject to really quite strict  limitations  whilst it is in public ownership so we  have said that it's the right time to  think about  you know a future model for the  ownership of channel 4 which will make  sure that it continues to go on  providing that very distinctive content  uh and serving the public service remit  which it has  uh way into the future why would you  want to get rid of it when it's it's had  its best financial year  last year ever  well we don't want to get rid of it we  want to sustain it this is about making  sure that it has a long-term future  in a very different world to the one  which most people are familiar with  [Music]  we are looking at the ownership  possibilities one of the  requirements i think over the coming  years is that channel 4 needs to have  access to the kind of capital investment  it is you know in order to retain  viewers you do need investment in good  content um and with some of the new  entrants netflix and amazon they are  spending huge amounts more  than channel 4 is able to do and an  alternative ownership model may make it  uh possible for them to  access the kind of money to continue to  provide great programming  okay i'm being told that you have to go  just want to ask you very quickly how  was the football last night you were at  the stadium weren't you  i was i there are some benefits of being  a dcms minister  um obviously it was a great result i was  delighted that england won  um you know i'm looking forward i don't  think i probably could manage to get  there again but i should certainly be  watching  uh the match next week and hopefully  we'll go all the way

